        "Id2": {
            "text": "Train released Mermaid, produced by the Espionage team, shortly before covering John Lennon's Imagine. Imagine by John Lennon earned the FIMI certification."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "The Train song Mermaid, produced by the Espionage production team, was followed by the band\u2019s cover of the John Lennon song Imagine. Musician John Lennon wrote and also originally performed the song Imagine which is certified by FIMI."
